# ECHO environment configuration
#
# ECHO needs NO build-time environment variables to run. AI provider keys
# (Anthropic / Gemini) are entered by each user in the app (⚙️ Settings) and
# stored only in their browser's localStorage — never baked into the build.
#
# The only optional build-time override:
#
# Override the default "shared backend" endpoint (for self-hosting the
# Firebase Cloud Function). The Settings → "Custom backend URL" field
# overrides this at runtime.
# VITE_ECHO_BACKEND_URL=https://your-region-your-project.cloudfunctions.net/echoSimulator
